{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35876","headline":"依韵修睦上人山居十首 四 · 李咸用","name":"依韵修睦上人山居十首 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不论轩冕及渔樵，性与情违渐渐遥。\n季子祸从怜富贵，颜生道在乐箪瓢。\n清闲自可齐三寿，忿恨还须戒一朝。\n好学尧民偎舜日，短裁孤竹理云韶。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李咸用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35876.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35876","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}